{chapter:'III · THE CROWNLESS',title:'The Last Oath',place:'THE HEART OF THE OLD WOOD',art:'heart',character:null,quest:'Decide what the kingdom’s future will be.',lead:'The ancient magic waits for an answer that no crown can give on your behalf.'

